      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGER'S BOY (6) has been out of the placings at his last two outings but shapes well for this if he can recapture his head turning win a few runs back, getting around Warrnambool over 450m in 25.27. Hard to top on best recent times. STAR FURY (3) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for three wins and two minors. Was out of the placings last time (24.34) at Bendigo in a Grade 4/5, finishing fourth and beaten 8 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. ANCHOR CRANKER (7) got around 390m in a strong 22.14 when winning a Free For All at Warrnambool last start. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. HE'S A COLLINDA (1) profiles nicely over this trip.",
